  "rule_description": "JEP 398 (JDK 17) deprecates java.applet.Applet, AppletStub, AppletContext, AudioClip, javax.swing.JApplet and java.beans.AppletInitializer for removal, on the grounds that browser vendors have dropped the Java plug-in. JADE carries an applet entry point (jade.AppletBoot) and an applet-hosted DF GUI client (jade.tools.applet). Compiling on JDK 17 produces four [removal] warnings for Applet; the code still compiles and the classes still load, so nothing is broken today. What the rule records is that this subtree has no supported deployment target left and is on the removal list for a future release.",
  "rule_id": "APPLET_API_DEPRECATED_FOR_REMOVAL",
